## Required context

__EXECUTION_CONTEXT__

This is a read-only projection of `__PRD_FILE__` (the task plan, not the prose PRD).
Use the selected story and its complete criteria. Read other plan entries or
requirements only when a dependency, finding or implementation decision needs them.
Read Codebase Patterns and the latest relevant entries of `__PROGRESS_FILE__`;
search older entries when an unresolved decision or finding requires their evidence.
Do not load the entire history merely because another iteration started.
